WEBVTT

00:11:30.269 --> 00:11:33.313
That's what's possible in phase four.

00:11:34.565 --> 00:11:37.067
And do you remember the five losses

00:11:37.109 --> 00:11:39.695
that we talked about in phase two?

00:11:39.695 --> 00:11:43.824
Loss of our routine and identity
and relationships

00:11:43.866 --> 00:11:45.993
and purpose and power.

00:11:46.034 --> 00:11:49.288
In phase four, these are all recovered.

00:11:49.329 --> 00:11:51.874
It is magic to see.

00:11:51.915 --> 00:11:53.292
Magic.

00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:59.381
So I urge you to enjoy
your vacation in phase one.